text.en:
Requires <void/>Smoke Bomb to be equipped to function.

Killing <void/>Weakened enemies grants 30% <void/>Smoke Bomb Melee Energy and releases a <void/>Weakening puff of <void/>Void Smoke at their location.

<void/>Void Smoke is functionally identical to <void/>Smoke Bomb and triggers melee-associated effects.

//Void Smoke isn't really an official verb but it feels like one worthy of the icon
//Melee Energy may be better reported as 10%, DDC has chosen 30%.
//Awaiting verdict on default cooldown reporting
